      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When downsizing departments, prioritize transparency, empathy, and clear communication to minimize impact on employees. Schedule regular town hall meetings, involve department heads in the decision-making process, and provide detailed explanations of the reasons behind the changes. Offer support, such as counseling services and outplacement assistance, to help affected employees transition to new roles or leave the company with dignity.",
